{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://schemas.spec-kitty.ai/charter/packs/charter.schema.json",
  "$defs": {
    "ActivationEntry": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "One entry in the charter-level activation registry.\n\nShape (per data-model.md §3 and contracts/activation-registry.md)::\n\n    activations:\n      - activation_context:\n          mission_type: software-dev   # optional, defaults to wildcard\n          action: implement            # optional, defaults to wildcard\n        charter_pack_id: very-serious-developers\n        artifact_id: caveman-comments\n        artifact_kind: styleguides     # optional disambiguator\n\nWildcards\n---------\nAbsence of a slot in ``activation_context`` is equivalent to the\nexplicit wildcard tokens ``any`` / ``generic`` — both forms match every\nconcrete value. This keeps operator-authored entries terse while still\nallowing the explicit wildcard for clarity.\n\nRetired field\n-------------\n``charter_pack_id`` replaced an earlier field name (#3732, OD-1). An entry\nthat still carries the retired name is rejected with ``RETIRED_PACK_FIELD``\nnaming the replacement (the table lives in\n``charter.offering.packs.retired_fields``, scope\n``SCOPE_ACTIVATION_ENTRY``), for both the project\n``charter.yaml`` and an ``org-charter.yaml``; there is no alias (C-001).",
      "properties": {
        "activation_context": {
          "additionalProperties": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": "Activation Context",
          "type": "object"
        },
        "charter_pack_id": {
          "title": "Charter Pack Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "artifact_id": {
          "title": "Artifact Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "artifact_kind": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Artifact Kind"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "activation_context",
        "charter_pack_id",
        "artifact_id"
      ],
      "title": "ActivationEntry",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "BranchStrategyConfig": {
      "description": "Git branch strategy and rules.",
      "properties": {
        "main_branch": {
          "default": "main",
          "title": "Main Branch",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "dev_branch": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Dev Branch"
        },
        "rules": {
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": "Rules",
          "type": "array"
        }
      },
      "title": "BranchStrategyConfig",
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "CharterCatalog": {
      "description": "The DERIVED-but-committed ``catalog`` projection (charter contract G2).\n\nMirrors the retired ``references.yaml`` body verbatim: ``mission``,\n``template_set``, ``languages``, ``references``. Kept honest by the\ncatalog<->activation parity check (``consistency_check.py``) plus\nfreshness (data-model.md Landmine 2 extension).\n\n``languages`` is nullable (issue #3292 fix): ``None`` distinguishes \"no\nactive-language signal was found at compile time\" from a genuinely\npersisted empty list. ``charter.activation.language_scope.infer_repo_languages``\n(the single authority both this compiler and the active charter\nservice's language gate consume) treats a ``None``/absent field as \"keep looking,\nthen admit all\" and a present-but-empty list as authoritative \"admit\nnone\" — collapsing the former into the latter on write is exactly the\ncompile-then-read feedback loop #3292 closes. See that function's\ndocstring for the full resolution contract.",
      "properties": {
        "mission": {
          "title": "Mission",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "template_set": {
          "title": "Template Set",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "languages": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Languages"
        },
        "references": {
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/CharterCatalogReference"
          },
          "title": "References",
          "type": "array"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "mission",
        "template_set"
      ],
      "title": "CharterCatalog",
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "CharterCatalogReference": {
      "description": "One reference item inside the charter.yaml ``catalog`` projection.\n\nMirrors the retired ``references.yaml`` reference-item shape (charter\ncontract G2): ``catalog`` is byte-equivalent in content to that file's\nbody, so parity/resolving consumers (``consistency_check.py``) see\nidentical data.",
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "title": "Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "kind": {
          "title": "Kind",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "title": {
          "title": "Title",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "summary": {
          "title": "Summary",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "source_path": {
          "title": "Source Path",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "local_path": {
          "title": "Local Path",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "id",
        "kind",
        "title",
        "summary",
        "source_path",
        "local_path"
      ],
      "title": "CharterCatalogReference",
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "CharterTestingConfig": {
      "description": "Testing requirements extracted from charter.",
      "properties": {
        "min_coverage": {
          "default": 0,
          "title": "Min Coverage",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "tdd_required": {
          "default": false,
          "title": "Tdd Required",
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "framework": {
          "default": "",
          "title": "Framework",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "type_checking": {
          "default": "",
          "title": "Type Checking",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "title": "CharterTestingConfig",
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "CharterYamlMetadata": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "``charter.yaml``'s ``metadata`` block (charter contract G4).\n\nDeliberately narrower than :class:`ExtractionMetadata`: Landmine 2\n(data-model.md) retires the self-referential ``charter_hash`` (a hash of\n``charter.yaml`` cannot live *inside* ``charter.yaml`` — chicken-egg)\nalong with ``extraction_mode``/``sections_parsed``, which have no\nmeaning once ``governance``/``directives``/activation are hand-authored\nrather than extracted. ``bundle_schema_version`` is KEPT — read by\n``versioning.py``.",
      "properties": {
        "generated_at": {
          "default": "",
          "title": "Generated At",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "bundle_schema_version": {
          "default": 2,
          "title": "Bundle Schema Version",
          "type": "integer"
        }
      },
      "title": "CharterYamlMetadata",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "CommitConfig": {
      "description": "Commit message conventions.",
      "properties": {
        "convention": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Convention"
        }
      },
      "title": "CommitConfig",
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "Directive": {
      "description": "A single numbered directive from the charter.\n\nCross-artifact applicability is now expressed via graph edges in\nthe ``packs/built-in/*.graph.yaml`` fragments rather than an inline\n``applies_to`` field\n(Phase 1 excision — mission\n``excise-doctrine-curation-and-inline-references-01KP54J6`` WP02).",
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "title": "Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "title": {
          "title": "Title",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "description": {
          "default": "",
          "title": "Description",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "severity": {
          "default": "warn",
          "title": "Severity",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "references": {
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": "References",
          "type": "array"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "id",
        "title"
      ],
      "title": "Directive",
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "DirectivesConfig": {
      "description": "Collection of directives extracted from charter.",
      "properties": {
        "directives": {
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/Directive"
          },
          "title": "Directives",
          "type": "array"
        }
      },
      "title": "DirectivesConfig",
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "GovernanceCharterConfig": {
      "description": "The ``governance.charter`` block: the charter-authored selection of governance artifacts.\n\nField naming mirrors the corresponding ``ActiveCharterService`` property\nname (e.g. ``selected_styleguides`` mirrors\n``ActiveCharterService.styleguides``). The ``selected_<kind>`` field set is\npinned against the ``ArtifactKind``-derived kind tables by\n``tests/architectural/test_kind_table_derivation.py``\n(``test_overlayable_is_the_selected_fields_minus_the_non_overlaid_kinds``).\nThe former property-introspection guard\n(``test_artifact_selection_completeness.py``) no longer exists.",
      "properties": {
        "selected_paradigms": {
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": "Selected Paradigms",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "selected_directives": {
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": "Selected Directives",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "selected_tactics": {
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": "Selected Tactics",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "selected_styleguides": {
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": "Selected Styleguides",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "selected_toolguides": {
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": "Selected Toolguides",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "selected_procedures": {
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": "Selected Procedures",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "selected_agent_profiles": {
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": "Selected Agent Profiles",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "selected_mission_step_contracts": {
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": "Selected Mission Step Contracts",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "selected_glossary_packs": {
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": "Selected Glossary Packs",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "selected_assets": {
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": "Selected Assets",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "available_tools": {
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": "Available Tools",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "template_set": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Template Set"
        },
        "authority_paths": {
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": "Authority Paths",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "governance_references": {
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": "Governance References",
          "type": "array"
        }
      },
      "title": "GovernanceCharterConfig",
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "GovernanceConfig": {
      "description": "Top-level governance configuration.",
